From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: The Playport authors <dev@playport.dev>
Date: Sun, 27 Sep 2026 21:50:00 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] crash_printer: include dbghelp.h in lower case

MinGW's headers are lower case (dbghelp.h), as they are in the Windows
SDK on a case-insensitive file system. On Linux a cross build with
llvm-mingw fails at <DbgHelp.h> with "file not found"; <dbghelp.h>
finds the same header on every host.

Class: linux-build
Evidence: docs/evidence/2026-09-27-gbe-steam-api-build.md
Offered-upstream: no
---
 crash_printer/win.cpp | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/crash_printer/win.cpp b/crash_printer/win.cpp
index e3c303e..e86a03f 100644
--- a/crash_printer/win.cpp
+++ b/crash_printer/win.cpp
@@ -10,7 +10,7 @@
 #define WIN32_LEAN_AND_MEAN
 #include <windows.h>
 
-#include <DbgHelp.h>
+#include <dbghelp.h>
 
 static LPTOP_LEVEL_EXCEPTION_FILTER originalExceptionFilter = nullptr;
 
